5%80%BC%E4%B8%8B%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%9A%B4%E5%87%BB%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E7%A8%8D%E5%BE%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E4%BD%8E%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%8F%8C%E6%9E%AA%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1632714690058\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/07bdce9e4261d5558c842f9cb25957c1_1069060182922088289.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>圣女祈祷</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">少有的增加能量回复的武器，可以加速角色SP恢复，契合依赖大招的双枪角色，附带的雷电伤害和暴伤意义不大。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/420d6b69a7a2beb9552936ff29477cac_8723140426253461883.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">关键被动技能令sp的回复速度得到不小的提升，可帮助开大输出的角色更快爆发。在战场中可帮助圣女更快开大，提供时空用于竞速。此外高会心和高能量值下提供的暴击伤害，能稍微改善低等级玩家物理双枪角色的输出能力。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/420d6b69a7a2beb9552936ff29477cac_8723140426253461883.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
